# Scoped to `docker/embed/Dockerfile` only (BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore`
# in preference to the context root's), so adding it here cannot change what the
# backend, frontend or geo-worker builds see.
#
# The build context has to be the repository root — the image imports the
# backend's `BGEM3Embedder` instead of re-implementing it — but the four files it
# actually needs are tiny. Everything else is excluded rather than shipped and
# then unused: an unbounded context is how a secret or a stray artifact ends up
# in a layer nobody meant to publish.
*
!docker/embed/app.py
!docker/embed/requirements-embed.lock
!gee-backend/app/domains/conocimiento/ddl.py
!gee-backend/app/domains/conocimiento/embedding.py
